        "description": "Local splitscreen for 2 to 4 players on one PC.\n\nUsage: Play Offline, then click Splitscreen in the mod list. A gold highlight means it is enabled.\nTo change the player count, click Edit options, type ssplayers=3 (2 to 4) on its own line, then click Save preset. Saving is needed even for the Temporary preset.\nP1 can also change ssplayers in their options. Splitscreen keeps these settings for future sessions.\n\nGuide, bug reports and feature requests:\nhttps://github.com/rebelancap/Chiv2-Splitscreen",
