            "pak_file_name": "Splitscreen.pak",
            "release_date": "2026-11-26T16:20:33",
            "release_notes_markdown": "Local splitscreen for Chivalry 2: 2 to 4 players on one PC.\n\n**Install:** through the Unchained Launcher, or put `Splitscreen.pak` in the game's `TBL\\Content\\Paks\\` folder. See the [README](https://github.com/rebelancap/Chiv2-Splitscreen#readme) for how to play and the options.\n\n\n- Bots on player 1's options page: number of bots (0 to 64) changed during the match, enhanced playerbots, all bots against the splitscreen players (`VS US`) or even teams, and the game mode of the next map\n- L3 switch on player 1's options page: throw and follow (default) or the game's own Alternate Attack, for all players (`ssl3=0`)\n- Options page in every player's loadout menu (View, or O on keyboard): look speed, inverted look, field of view and rumble per player\n- Player 1's options page also sets the player count, the screen split, gamepad or keyboard and mouse, and can end the match (hold A)\n- Side-by-side split for 2 players, switchable during a match (`sssplit=1`)\n- Per-player look speed can also be typed (`sslook=100,150`)\n- Fixed: Random (Y) in the loadout menu did nothing\n- Fixed: an unnamed second health bar flashing when aiming away from a player\n- Fixed: turning keyboard and mouse mode off left player 1 without rumble\n- Fixed: the scoreboard header was oversized in a half-width view\n- Known: gamepad aim assist does not work properly in splitscreen (it is measured from the centre of the whole screen)\n\n",
            "tag": "v0.6.0"
        },
